      "plan_variable": "pplan:vars/concept/selling_closure",
      "summary": "Selling-superbase closure: The complete finite set of obtuse superbases of one lattice (S\u2084\u00d7{\u00b1I} orbit at V1, plus extra classes at V2\u2013V5); enumerated for exact reindexing and identity certification. Zero conorms use a relative floor of 1e-9, widened by three angle-sigma widths (default 0.05 degrees), and a relative boundary width of 1e-3.",
      "agent": "agentsg-kg-builder/0.1 (Claude Fable 5.1, Cowork session, 2026-09-30)"
    },
