      },
      "plan_variable": "pplan:vars/concept/kurlin_root_form",
      "summary": "Kurlin root products / root form (isometry invariant): Six root products r_ij = \u221ap_ij of the obtuse superbase. Kurlin's ordered 2\u00d73 root form is a complete isometry invariant. The sorted six-tuple of those square roots is continuous, but it is not the archive search key: at a vanishing conorm the square root is only H\u00f6lder-\u00bd.",
      "agent": "agentsg-kg-builder/0.1 (Claude Fable 5.1, Cowork session, 2026-09-30)"
