      "plan_variable": "pplan:vars/concept/site_symmetry_stratum",
      "summary": "Site-symmetry stratum (direct-space fixed set): The locus of points in the unit cell with a given site-symmetry stabilizer: the intersection of the fixed-point loci of those operations. This is the direct-space counterpart of a reflection stratum. The two are analogous stratifications by stabilizer, not a lattice dual of each other.",
      "agent": "agentsg-kg-builder/0.1 (Claude Fable 5.1, Cowork session, 2026-09-30)"
    },
