      "summary": "PDB lattice search pipeline: The same path for a query and for each stored PDB cell: conventional cell, primitive cell from the centring letter, Selling reduction, the sorted linear key in columns l0..l5, then a KD-tree radius query. pipeline.invariant is sorted_linear_key. Columns r0..r5 keep Kurlin's square-root products and are not the search key.",
      "agent": "agentsg-kg-builder/0.1 (Claude Fable 5.1, Cowork session, 2026-09-30)"
    },
